# ...except the ship-data validator's baseline: it is derived from the repo alone, so it is committed and
# every clone gets the same checkShipData.php gate (a commit deleted it once, in 2026-09). Git cannot
# re-include a file under an excluded directory, hence the three steps.
!/tests/shipdata/
/tests/shipdata/*
!/tests/shipdata/baseline.txt
.claude

